\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. For ever with the Lord!
\par Amen; so let it be:
\par Life from the dead is in that word;
\par 'Tis immortality.
\par Here in the body pent,
\par Absent from Him I roam,
\par Yet nightly pitch my moving tent
\par A day's march nearer home.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My Father's house on high,
\par Home of my soul, how near
\par At times, to faith's foreseeing eye,
\par Thy golden gates appear!
\par Ah! then my spirit faints
\par To reach the land I love,
\par The bright inheritance of saints,
\par Jerusalem above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. For ever with the Lord!
\par Father, if 'tis Thy will,
\par The promise of that faithful word
\par Even here to me fulfil.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Be Thou at my right hand,
\par Then can I never fail;
\par Uphold Thou me, and I shall
\par stand,
\par Fight, and I must prevail.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. So when my latest breath
\par Shall rend the veil in twain,
\par By death I shall escape from death
\par And life eternal gain,
\par Knowing as I am known,
\par How shall I love that word,
\par And oft repeat before the throne:
\par For ever with the Lord!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

